        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, winter 2018</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, winter 2018
The operational electricity consumption (heating, hot water, ventilation, lighting, and auxiliaries) is modelled by a specific electricity mix used for the electricity consumption of Switzerland in winter 2018.;
UUID: fdc628a0-bb09-3da8-b2e0-a46e584af7ab
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the electricity consumption in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fdc628a0-bb09-3da8-b2e0-a46e584af7ab.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
